Energy per operation (first-order literature values; override with the options above):
  synop   2.36e-11 J per synaptic event — Intel Loihi, Davies et al., IEEE Micro 2018
  mac     4.6e-12 J per FP32 multiply-accumulate — Horowitz, ISSCC 2014 (45 nm): 3.7 pJ mult + 0.9 pJ add
  op      9e-13 J per FP32 add / compare — Horowitz, ISSCC 2014 (45 nm)
  sram    5e-12 J per 32-bit SRAM read — Horowitz, ISSCC 2014: ~10 pJ per 64-bit read, 8 KB SRAM
  adc     4e-10 J per 12-bit ADC conversion — ~100 fJ per conversion step × 4096 (low-power SAR)
  led_vf  3 V forward voltage, 450 nm InGaN microLED — typical for blue InGaN LEDs
  heater  0.01 W per MOx sensor heater — order of magnitude for MEMS micro-hotplates (datasheet-dependent)

